---
/**
 * One sentence that makes the reader feel known, so the food that follows reads
 * as theirs rather than as stock.
 *
 * This band is also the page's breath — a short, quiet strip between a tall hero
 * and a tall grid. Nothing in it but type on the optical left edge.
 */
---
<section class="section section--tight recog">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="recog-line" data-reveal>You already have a list.<br />It's four places long.</p>
    <p class="mono recog-sub" data-reveal>
      The same kitchens for years, because somebody in the family checked once — and everywhere
      else stayed a question.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .recog { background: var(--surface-base); }
  .recog-line {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .recog-sub { max-width: 62ch; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
